<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Sowits shares suspended on JSE.</title>
<headline>Sowits shares suspended on JSE.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Johannesburg Stock Exchange said on Friday it had suspended Southern Witwatersrand Exploration Company Ltd's (Sowits) listing on the exchange with immediate effect.</p>
<p>The exchange said in a statement the company's shares had been suspended in terms of Section 17 of the Stock Exchanges Constrol Act pending clarification on certain aspects disclosed in the company's rights offer circular issued on November 8.</p>
<p>The exchange gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
